          "text": "NOW  ·  Editable exports, geometry checks and safe local repairs.\nNEXT  ·  Broader chart coverage, layout policies and rendered PPTX regression tests.\nLATER  ·  Optional model adapters and collaborative authoring.",
          "fontSize": 24
